# Live files

App folder = **code only**. Resolve via `shared/paths.py` / `load_config`.

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `python -m scripts.app.main` | convert / print / void |
| `runtime/Shipping/DTF Des Files/` | Input desfiles |
| `runtime/Shipping/DTF Des Files - Processed/` | Archived inputs |
| `config/Shipping/shipping_config.yaml` | Tuneables |
| `config/ShipStation/.env` | ShipStation secrets |
| `config/Shipping/.env` | Optional app overrides (no API keys) |
| `runtime/Shipping/Output/` | Labels and batch PDFs |

Does **not** auto-read SharedInbox yet.
